          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 17 2022 18:41:35 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2>Maintaining Normothermia and Fever Management</h2>\n<h3>Learning objectives</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Define normothermia, hypothermia, and hyperthermia</li>\n<li>Identify the causes and symptoms of hyperthermia and hypothermia</li>\n<li>Identify specific patient populations that are at increased risk for hypothermia and hyperthermia</li>\n<li>Explain the different types of treatment plans that can be utilized to achieve normothermia<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
